ey are inquiring into the matter.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">悉く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ことごとく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">全部地；悉数地；统统</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">今年</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ことし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/kanji/\">N5</a><span class=\"v-m\">今年</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../n5/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">年</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">言付ける</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ことづける</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">托人捎话；托人传递（信件、包裹等）；以…为借口；托词</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">言伝</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ことづて</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">口信；传言；传闻；谣言</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"75802\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>死<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んだことは<ruby>言伝<rp>(</rp><rt>ことづて</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>知<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I heard that he&#x27;d died.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">異なる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ことなる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">不同；有区别；相异；有分歧；相差</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"166918\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちの<ruby>性格<rp>(</rp><rt>せいかく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はまったく<ruby>異<rp>(</rp><rt>こと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Our characters are completely different.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">殊に</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ことに</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">尤其；特别；格外；最重要的是；另外；此外</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"178762\"><ruby>君<rp>(</rp><rt>きみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>意見<rp>(</rp><rt>いけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>異<rp>(</rp><rt>こと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にするので<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>心苦<rp>(</rp><rt>こころぐる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">It pains me to disagree with your opinion.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">事によると</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ことによると</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">或许；也许；可能</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"224093\">ことによると、きみにも<ruby>一緒<rp>(</rp><rt>いっしょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にきてもらう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Maybe you&#x27;d better come with us.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">言葉</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ことば</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">语言；方言；词；短语；表达；术语；言语；说话方式；语言运用；话语；言辞；陈述；评论；学语；语言习得</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"174713\"><ruby>言葉<rp>(</rp><rt>ことば</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>で</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>てこなかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Words failed me.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">言葉遣い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ことばづかい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">说话方式；措辞；语言运用</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"174675\"><ruby>言葉遣<rp>(</rp><rt>ことばづか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いにはいつも<ruby>気<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をつけるべきです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">You should always be careful in your speech.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">小鳥</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ことり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">小鸟；小鸟儿</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"146915\"><ruby>小鳥<rp>(</rp><rt>ことり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちはたのしそうにさえずっています。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The birds are singing merrily.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">諺</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ことわざ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">谚语；俗语；格言；箴言</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"223759\">このことわざが<ruby>使<rp>(</rp><rt>つか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>われるのを<ruby>聞<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いた<ruby>事<rp>(</rp><rt>こと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>があります。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I have heard this proverb used.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">断る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ことわる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">拒绝</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>忙<rp>(</rp><rt>いそが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しいので、<ruby>誘<rp>(</rp><rt>さそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いを<ruby>断<rp>(</rp><rt>ことわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\">因为忙，拒绝了邀请。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">孤独</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こどく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">孤独；寂寞；孤立</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"160850\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はこの<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>うえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なくさびしく、<ruby>孤独<rp>(</rp><rt>こどく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I am as sad and lonely as can be.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">子供</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こども</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><spa